# The GPU app's prebuilt Skia (rust-skia/skia-binaries releases on GitHub), checked by tools/build_app.sh before
# skia-bindings gets it. One line per skia-bindings version and binaries key: the version, the key and the SHA-256 of
# skia-binaries-<key>.tar.gz. The key is the one skia-bindings' build script makes: the first 20 characters of the
# rust-skia commit (the sha1 in the crate's .cargo_vcs_info.json), the target and the Skia features, as in the
# release's file names. tools/build_app.sh works it out before the build and names it when it is missing here.
